# BaoTime — Third-Party Dependency & Upstream Reference Inventory

This document records the SPDX licence identifiers, upstream `NOTICE` status, and attribution/obligation notes for upstream API references and third-party Gradle dependencies used by BaoTime (`com.baotime.app`).

## Upstream API & Event References (Zero Source Files Copied)

BaoTime is an independent Kotlin/Android View implementation of a FaceTime-web client for a personal BlueBubbles Mac server. No Flutter/Dart (`lib/…`), Kotlin plugin (`android/app/src/main/kotlin/com/bluebubbles/messaging/…`), or macOS helper source files from BlueBubbles are copied into this repository. Only public HTTP REST route paths, Socket.IO event names, and JSON payload field names are referenced. This engineering approach is not a certified legal clean-room process.

